[h1]Notifications on Map[/h1]

Makes the [b]Notification window[/b] available while the [b]Map is open[/b]. Normally, game notifications are suppressed when the Map is displayed - this mod restores them, so you never miss an alert while managing your empire.

[h2][b]Features[/b][/h2]
[list]
[*] [b]Notifications in map mode[/b]: The notification window is shown while the map is open, just as it would be in normal flight view.
[*] [b]It still made by Egosoft[/b]: The mod does not create a new notification system, it simply "reveals" the existing one in map mode, by forcing it to be shown and adjusting its position to minimize interference with the map UI.
[*] [b]Notifications still suppressed in other modes[/b]: Notifications are only shown in map mode - they remain hidden in other modes (e.g. station view).
[*] [b]Configurable[/b]: The feature can be toggled on or off as via [b]Options Menu > Extension options > Notifications on Map[/b] as via [b]Context Menu[/b].
[*] [b]Compatible with X4 8.00 and 9.00[/b], but currently published for 9.00 only.
[*] [b]Can work with SWI[/b] - please use with the [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/x4foundations/mods/2134]kuertee UI Extensions and HUD for SW Interworlds adoption mod[/url].
[/list]
[h2][b]Requirements[/b][/h2]
[list]
[*] Please use only [b]latest version[/b] of the [b]UI Extensions and HUD[/b] for appropriate game version!
[*] [b]X4: Foundations[/b]: Version [b]8.00[/b] and [b]UI Extensions and HUD[/b]: Version [b]v8.0.4.5[/b] or higher (in v8.x branch) by [url=https://next.nexusmods.com/profile/kuertee?gameId=2659]kuertee[/url].
[*] [b]X4: Foundations[/b]: Version [b]9.00[/b] or higher and [b]UI Extensions and HUD[/b]: Version [b]v9.0.0.5[/b] or higher (in v9.x branch) by [url=https://next.nexusmods.com/profile/kuertee?gameId=2659]kuertee[/url].
[*] [b]Mod Support APIs[/b]: Version 1.95 or higher by [url=https://next.nexusmods.com/profile/sirnukes?gameId=2659]SirNukes[/url]:
[list]
[*] Available on Steam: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2042901274]SirNukes Mod Support APIs[/url]
[*] Available on Nexus Mods: [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/x4foundations/mods/503]Mod Support APIs[/url]
[/list]
[*] [b]Options Helper[/b] version 1.0 or higher by [url=https://next.nexusmods.com/profile/ChemODun/mods?gameId=2659]Chem O\`Dun[/url]:
[list]
[*] [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3715253556]Steam Workshop[/url]
[*] [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/x4foundations/mods/2089]Nexus Mods[/url]
[/list]
[*] [b](Optional)[/b] [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/x4foundations/mods/2181]Native Hotkey API[/url] version 8.00.03 or higher by [url=https://next.nexusmods.com/profile/ChemODun/mods?gameId=2659]Chem O\`Dun[/url] - only needed to assign a hotkey for toggling notifications in map mode. Not required otherwise.
[/list]
[h2][b]Installation[/b][/h2]
[list]
[*] [b]Steam Workshop[/b]: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3722049740]Notifications on Map[/url] - currently only for 8.00, due to limitations of Steam Workshop for X4 mods.
[*] [b]Nexus Mods[/b]: [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/x4foundations/mods/2103]Notifications on Map[/url] - there are separate versions for 8.00 (8.00.xx) and 9.00 (9.00.xx), so make sure to download the correct one for your game version.
[/list]
[h2][b]Usage[/b][/h2]

The notification window will not appear in map mode until you enable it from the extension options. Open [b]Options Menu > Extension options > Notifications on Map[/b] and toggle [b]Show Notifications in Map Mode[/b] to your preference. The change takes effect immediately - no need to restart the game.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chemodun/X4-NotificationsOnMap/refs/heads/main/docs/images/notifications_on_map.png[/img]

[h2]Context Menu[/h2]

Simple press righ button in the map mode on free space in any sector and you will see the context menu with options to show or hide notifications in map mode.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chemodun/X4-NotificationsOnMap/refs/heads/main/docs/images/context_menu_to_show.png[/img][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chemodun/X4-NotificationsOnMap/refs/heads/main/docs/images/context_menu_to_hide.png[/img]

[h2]Hotkey (optional)[/h2]

If [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/x4foundations/mods/2181]Native Hotkey API[/url] is installed, a [b]Toggle Notifications Window in Map Mode[/b] action becomes available in its [b]Hotkey Management[/b] menu (added to the top-level Options menu), so you can assign a key to toggle the feature on/off without opening any menu. This is a purely optional integration - no extra configuration option is added here, and the mod works exactly the same without Native Hotkey API installed.

[h2][b]Extension Options[/b][/h2]

Open [b]Options Menu > Extension options > Notifications on Map[/b] to configure the mod.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chemodun/X4-NotificationsOnMap/refs/heads/main/docs/images/options.png[/img]

[h2]General[/h2]
[list]
[*] [b]Show Notifications in Map Mode[/b]: Enable or disable the notification window while the map is open. Default: off.
[*] [b]Switch via Context Menu[/b]: Enable or disable the context menu options to show/hide notifications in map mode. Default: off.
[/list]
[h2]Debug[/h2]
[list]
[*] [b]Debug Mode[/b]: Sets the logging verbosity. Options: [b]None[/b] (default), [b]Debug[/b], [b]Trace[/b]. Useful for troubleshooting only - leave at None during normal play.
[/list]
